  "onboardingIntroGetStarted": "Get started",
  "onboardingIntroPage1Title": "A private place to write",
  "onboardingIntroPage1Item0": "Your diary is encrypted on this device, so you can keep writing offline.",
  "onboardingIntroPage1Item1": "No Quill Diary account, no ads, and no behavioral tracking.",
  "onboardingIntroPage1Item2": "Protect your diary with a PIN, fingerprint, or face unlock, and have the app lock automatically.",
  "onboardingIntroPage2Title": "Write your way",
  "onboardingIntroPage2Item0": "Write naturally, use Markdown when you want formatting, and switch to preview anytime.",
  "onboardingIntroPage2Item1": "Add checklists and tick them off directly in preview.",
  "onboardingIntroPage2Item2": "Attach photos and files; they are encrypted with the rest of your diary.",
  "onboardingIntroPage3Title": "Connect memories with tags and people",
  "onboardingIntroPage3Item0": "Create color-coded tags to categorize entries, then use the Tags page to quickly find related records.",
  "onboardingIntroPage3Item1": "Keep names, aliases, relationships, birthdays, and notes in People; type @ while writing to mention someone quickly.",
  "onboardingIntroPage3Item2": "Quill Diary uses names and aliases to gather related entries and show mention counts and the most recent mention.",
  "onboardingIntroPage3Item3": "Use the timeline, calendar, search, and Overview to revisit your life from different angles.",
  "onboardingIntroPage4Title": "Your recovery key is your spare key",
  "onboardingIntroPage4Item0": "A unique recovery key is created when you start a new diary.",
  "onboardingIntroPage4Item1": "Keep a copy away from this device. You will need it after reinstalling the app, moving devices, or restoring a backup.",
  "onboardingIntroPage4Item2": "Quill Diary does not keep a copy for you. If it is lost, neither the app nor the developer can recover your diary.",
  "onboardingIntroPage5Title": "Your data stays in your hands",
  "onboardingIntroPage5Item0": "Create a full backup with your diary entries kept encrypted, and save it as a file or in Google Drive.",
  "onboardingIntroPage5Item1": "Backups are created when you choose—they do not sync automatically. Restore one to move to another device.",
  "onboardingIntroPage5Item2": "You can also import Markdown, HTML, and supported backups from other diary apps.",
  "onboardingIntroPage5Item3": "Export Markdown or HTML when you want readable files elsewhere. Exports are not encrypted, so store them carefully.",
